00:57:04,000 --> 00:57:09,000
Case number 7, which is our negative
earnings growth.

361
00:57:09,000 --> 00:57:10,000
Earnings growth.

362
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:14,000
That's below sector average in the first
period.

363
00:57:14,000 --> 00:57:21,000
But remember, this case still has positive
EPS.

364
00:57:21,000 --> 00:57:27,000
So we have the negative below sector
average earnings growth in period one.

365
00:57:27,000 --> 00:57:37,000
And then in period two for the stock, we
have positive earnings growth percentage,
but it's below the sector average.

366
00:57:37,000 --> 00:57:49,000
In this situation, this type of earnings
growth profile, when we are processing in
