earnings growth profiles that we could
potentially have in our portfolio to
diversify our earnings growth profiles and
to diversify the types of long trades that
we have in the portfolio.

385
01:00:15,000 --> 01:00:22,000
We will be discussing this in subsequent
videos further in the video series.

386
01:00:22,000 --> 01:00:32,000
Next up is our case number 10, where
again, like case number seven, this is
pretty useless to us.

387
01:00:32,000 --> 01:00:38,000
But in this situation, the company is loss
making.

388
01:00:38,000 --> 01:00:42,000
So they have negative EPS in the first
period.

389
01:00:42,000 --> 01:00:45,000
Their earnings growth is negative and
below the sector average.

390
01:00:45,000 --> 01:00:53,000
And in the second period, their earnings
